{"chunkType": "excerpt", "collectedBy": "claude-opus-5", "collectionSession": "35688042-a8bd-4439-a235-e32a83d25f6c", "date": null, "fetchedAt": "2026-09-08T07:43:03Z", "id": "chunk_scenes-122_early_localities_hwangsan-burn", "lang": "ko", "locator": "본문 '역사적 배경'", "pageSha256": "e9a2d39676d0ce07dcd458c4fc976dd67add40d5e3fdcc133a84c307e0ffdb31", "permalink": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0065178", "sourceId": "src-syj122-aks-hwangsan", "sourceUrl": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0065178", "text": "왜구는 남원(南原) 운봉현(雲峯縣)을 방화하고"}
{"chunkType": "excerpt", "collectedBy": "claude-opus-5", "collectionSession": "35688042-a8bd-4439-a235-e32a83d25f6c", "date": null, "fetchedAt": "2026-09-08T07:43:03Z", "id": "chunk_scenes-122_early_localities_hwangsan-aji", "lang": "ko", "locator": "본문 '경과'", "pageSha256": "e9a2d39676d0ce07dcd458c4fc976dd67add40d5e3fdcc133a84c307e0ffdb31", "permalink": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0065178", "sourceId": "src-syj122-aks-hwangsan", "sourceUrl": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0065178", "text": "이성계와 이지란(李之蘭) 이 협공으로 아지발도를 사살한"}
{"chunkType": "excerpt", "collectedBy": "claude-opus-5", "collectionSession": "35688042-a8bd-4439-a235-e32a83d25f6c", "date": null, "fetchedAt": "2026-09-08T07:43:03Z", "id": "chunk_scenes-122_early_localities_hwangsan-spot", "lang": "ko", "locator": "본문 '경과'", "pageSha256": "e9a2d39676d0ce07dcd458c4fc976dd67add40d5e3fdcc133a84c307e0ffdb31", "permalink": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0065178", "sourceId": "src-syj122-aks-hwangsan", "sourceUrl": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0065178", "text": "교전이 이루어진 곳은 황산 북쪽의 정산봉(鼎山峰)"}
